This directory contains a manual test of dependent random distributions:
how does the distribution of a variable x_n look when it is calculated
from the formula "Const - Sum(x_1 ... x_(n-1))"? It answers this question
for 1-4 "free" variables and writes a file from which the ROOT analysis
toolkit (see http://root.cern.ch) draws the distributions, for a look by eye.

After calling the main executable, run

root -l rootPlotDependentDistributions.C

to inspect the results.
